  "question": {
    "text": "The number of 3 -digit numbers, that are divisible by 2 and 3 , but not divisible by 4 and 9 , is______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "125",
  "solution": {
    "text": "No, of 3 digits $=999-99=900$\nNo. of 3 digit numbers divisible by 2 & 3 i.e. by 6\n$\\frac{900}{6}=150$\n\nNo. of 3 digit numbers divisible by 4 & 9 i.e. by 36\n$\\frac{900}{36}=25$\n$\\therefore$ No of 3 digit numbers divisible by $2 ~\\&~ 3$ but not by $4 ~\\&~ 9$\n$150-25=125$",
    "image": null
  },
